<section number="8.4" title="Solve Equations with Fraction or Decimal Coefficients">
  <learning_objectives>
    <objective number="" />
    <objective number="" />
  </learning_objectives>
  <note type="Be Prepared" number="8.10">
    <p>Before you get started, take this readiness quiz.</p>
    <p>Multiply: $$8 \cdot \frac{3}{8}.$$
If you missed this problem, review Example 4.28</p>
  </note>
